        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/61157623?u=b22ddf1ed53b6b321b8ca765d35de776a18931fb&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><p dir=\"auto\">Allow users to automatically start the <code class=\"notranslate\">default</code> network without imperatively symlinking in /var/lib/libvirt/qemu/networks or running <code class=\"notranslate\">sudo virsh net-start default</code> on startup.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Related PR: <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"1337774777\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/NixOS/nixpkgs/issues/186358\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/NixOS/nixpkgs/pull/186358/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/NixOS/nixpkgs/pull/186358\">#186358</a></p>\n<h2 dir=\"auto\">Description of changes</h2>\n\n<h2 dir=\"auto\">Things done</h2>\n\n<ul class=\"contains-task-list\">\n<li>Built on platform(s)\n<ul class=\"contains-task-list\">\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Completed task\" checked=\"\"> x86_64-linux</li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Incomplete task\"> aarch64-linux</li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Incomplete task\"> x86_64-darwin</li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Incomplete task\"> aarch64-darwin</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>For non-Linux: Is sandboxing enabled in <code class=\"notranslate\">nix.conf</code>? (See <a href=\"https://nixos.org/manual/nix/stable/command-ref/conf-file.html\" rel=\"nofollow\">Nix manual</a>)\n<ul class=\"contains-task-list\">\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" d